    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Dehdehbon is an action game filled to the brim with tight platforming, awesome combos and satisfying movement! Well, if you're good, anyway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/dd063c019deff852d7c251300c89f65c.avif?t=1754684781\" width=1196 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of movement options! Wall sliding, wall jumping, ledge grabs, sliding, etc. Every action has a satisfying weight to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things might get pretty tough, think you can handle it? (you can't)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/ebb19139f92476da38e7834c4806ba0f.avif?t=1754684781\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hitting enemies sure is fun. Y'know you want to, yeah it'll be fun, c'mooonnn..... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/a4d6235dd67d545c53c82af58b31b9b1.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/a4d6235dd67d545c53c82af58b31b9b1.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/a4d6235dd67d545c53c82af58b31b9b1.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding W has never been more fun than it is now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/9465ca80ee7ec442cec17139755c0b54.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/9465ca80ee7ec442cec17139755c0b54.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/9465ca80ee7ec442cec17139755c0b54.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/30b1f2d3d81563c05815dba098018499.avif?t=1754684781\" width=1196 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/cdeb47f71f9cb62bff750f496d77466f.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/cdeb47f71f9cb62bff750f496d77466f.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/cdeb47f71f9cb62bff750f496d77466f.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/f583cde3e9dc44f14616d738b089c5ba.avif?t=1754684781\" width=1196 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe take a break from that and go for a new PB in some mini games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/db09bc62e4a6ac1182a8139342f7a31a.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/db09bc62e4a6ac1182a8139342f7a31a.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/db09bc62e4a6ac1182a8139342f7a31a.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >funny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/46e6938056fcd120f8cb753bb4955d4a.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/46e6938056fcd120f8cb753bb4955d4a.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/46e6938056fcd120f8cb753bb4955d4a.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release date? Uh...... let me check...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Dehdehbon is an action game filled to the brim with tight platforming, awesome combos and satisfying movement! Well, if you're good, anyway...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/dd063c019deff852d7c251300c89f65c.avif?t=1754684781\" width=1196 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of movement options! Wall sliding, wall jumping, ledge grabs, sliding, etc. Every action has a satisfying weight to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/bddb4c83616723d14cbb6076e37bc40b.mp4?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things might get pretty tough, think you can handle it? (you can't)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.poster.avif?t=1754684781\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.webm?t=1754684781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422490/extras/96c3751974d2c6b59328543608d35c80.mp4?t=1754684781\" t